    guide: { signs: 'A dark wall in near-black; letters and simple line drawings as glowing tubes in two or three saturated colours (pink, cyan, warm yellow); a halo of light on the wall around them; tubes switch on with a stutter and some keep a faint flicker; no other light in the frame.', build: 'Text in the neon font with a "glow" clip (color = the tube colour, size 1.2-2, strength 1-1.4, flicker on for one or two signs, off for the rest) that stays on to the exit. Line drawings are path layers in the tube colour (stroke 0.4-0.6, round caps) drawn on with draw, then a glow. Switch things on with stepped fades (steps(3) or steps(4)), not slides. A wide soft ellipse of the tube colour at low opacity behind each sign for the light on the wall. Keep motion minimal: the light is the movement.' },
